<title>RUSSIA: Russia to sell second Svyazinvest stake Sept/Oct.</title>
<headline>Russia to sell second Svyazinvest stake Sept/Oct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia plans to sell a second, 24 percent stake in telecoms holding company OAO Svyazinvest in September or October this year, a senior government source told Reuters on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We plan to sell (the 24 percent stake) in September or October,&quot; said the source, who did not wish to be named.</p>
</text>
